- The global `tracker` module var is used by fetchExistingStoriesByParent/createStory/linkStory/linkToSource — keep the module-level `var tracker = null;` and set it in prepareStoryPlan.
- resolveKey closure → plan.keyMap with helper resolvePlanKey(plan, ref).
